WEBVTT

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:33.050
What did you say!?

00:01:33.160 --> 00:01:34.560
Akane...?

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:38.320
She left and hasn't come back.

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:41.060
How... How did this happen!?

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:47.470
There was a rash of food thefts
in the neighborhood lately...

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:53.130
Two sisters, Natsume and
Kurumi, were behind them.

00:01:55.350 --> 00:01:57.540
It smells so good!

00:01:57.950 --> 00:01:59.210
A-And then!?

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:10.590
They had no place to go, so we
asked them to stay at our home.

00:02:10.700 --> 00:02:15.290
But it seems that they may be
Father's illegitimate daughters.

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:18.370
What!? The old man's an adulterer!?

00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:26.030
Kasumi! Don't spread strange
rumors about your father.

00:02:26.140 --> 00:02:27.410
Father, hurry!

00:02:27.510 --> 00:02:29.710
Papa!

00:02:30.510 --> 00:02:32.710
Coming.

00:02:35.850 --> 00:02:38.340
Well, Ryoga, see you.

00:02:38.460 --> 00:02:42.360
Then the question came up,
who would carry on the Tendo Dojo?

00:02:42.730 --> 00:02:49.220
To decide it, Akane and Ranma
fought Natsume and Kurumi.

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:53.170
Ranma fought, too!?

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:56.930
Yes. But he couldn't
touch either of them.

00:02:58.380 --> 00:02:59.570
Ranma!

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:11.690
Now, Ranma is out looking for Akan...

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:13.980
Ryoga...

00:03:14.530 --> 00:03:16.990
Thanks for the souvenirs!

00:03:28.170 --> 00:03:30.900
What's the meaning of this, Akane?

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:34.710
You got a reason for
calling us out here?

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:38.980
Akane challenge both of us
at same time! She got nerve.

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:41.580
Stop talking and fight!

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:43.450
If you insist!

00:03:43.550 --> 00:03:44.950
I fight!

00:03:54.270 --> 00:03:55.930
You all right, Akane?

00:03:56.100 --> 00:03:57.620
You hang in there, Akane.

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:03.530
I can fight!

00:04:03.770 --> 00:04:06.110
Don't waste your strength.

00:04:06.280 --> 00:04:09.210
I'll never get the
Dojo back at this rate.

00:04:12.050 --> 00:04:14.240
So you lost the Dojo?

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:19.080
They were about
the same age as me...

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:24.250
No matter what I did, I couldn't
touch them. I can't believe it.

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:28.900
So you challenge us
to test strength?

00:04:29.300 --> 00:04:30.930
I'm sorry.

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:33.160
Akane, you silly girl.

00:04:33.470 --> 00:04:36.960
There's no need for apologies.
We're your friends, right?

00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:41.640
Friends help each other when
in trouble. We help you, now.

00:04:42.580 --> 00:04:45.310
Thanks, Ukyo, Shampoo!

00:04:45.820 --> 00:04:49.010
Now that Akane's not
inheriting the family Dojo...

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:51.780
Her engagement with
Ranma is all but over!

00:04:52.120 --> 00:04:55.490
I pretend to train Akane
then finish her off.

00:04:55.590 --> 00:04:58.530
Then Shampoo take
place as Ranma's bride!

00:04:59.130 --> 00:05:00.930
This is the chance of a lifetime!

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:03.290
Let's do it, Akane!

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:05.870
You defeat those sisters!

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:25.850
Uhhh...

00:05:28.490 --> 00:05:31.360
Ukyo! Don't you think
you're overdoing it...

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:33.420
Can't do this halfway!

00:05:33.530 --> 00:05:37.520
You'll never beat those
sisters as you are now!

00:05:44.510 --> 00:05:45.700
Ukyo! Behind you!

00:05:45.810 --> 00:05:48.010
What?

00:05:50.650 --> 00:05:52.950
Watch where you
throw things, Shampoo!

00:05:53.050 --> 00:05:55.110
You trying to kill ME, too!?

00:05:56.150 --> 00:06:01.060
Shampoo marry Ranma.
I get rid of any obstacles.

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:02.020
Umm...

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:04.490
I'M gonna be
Ranma-honey's bride!

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:08.500
What you talking!?
Ranma belong Shampoo!

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:12.060
So much for female friendships...

00:06:21.010 --> 00:06:22.770
Father?

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:25.780
Kasumi! Is Akane still missing?

00:06:26.920 --> 00:06:29.440
I found her! She's two blocks away!

00:06:29.550 --> 00:06:31.950
Somebody spotted her
in a vacant lot!

00:06:32.060 --> 00:06:34.250
Vacant lot?

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:38.330
I'm home!

00:06:38.430 --> 00:06:39.860
Father, where are you going?

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:41.490
For some cigarettes!

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:43.790
I bought you some.

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:53.230
Geez! Akane's so stupid!
She didn't havta run away from home!

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:58.380
If she'd just left it to me,
I coulda beaten 'em no problem.

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:00.810
That's where you're wrong, Ranma!

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:02.410
Pop...

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:07.050
At your level of training,
you could never beat those two.

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:10.060
Now what're you talkin' about!?

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:12.760
Don't you get it, Ranma?

00:07:12.860 --> 00:07:16.990
You don't understand
your female self!

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:19.200
My female self?

00:07:19.300 --> 00:07:26.570
Others forced you to change,
or you only used it as a tool.

00:07:27.550 --> 00:07:29.270
Then...

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:30.750
Listen, Ranma!

00:07:30.850 --> 00:07:34.610
You have to face your
female self head on!

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:39.780
Until you fathom its true nature,
you can't defeat your enemy!

00:07:41.030 --> 00:07:43.290
I see. I get it, Pops.

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:46.760
Once in a while,
you almost make sense.

00:07:48.230 --> 00:07:50.220
Of course I do.

00:07:50.330 --> 00:07:53.860
I've accepted my own change.

00:07:58.000 --> 00:08:00.500
Observe! This is my true nature!

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:07.880
I take back any compliments I said.

00:08:08.190 --> 00:08:10.380
Father!

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:13.650
Kurumi, do you know
where Father is?

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:16.190
He said he was going
out for cigarettes.

00:08:16.590 --> 00:08:18.150
Cigarettes?

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:26.360
So, Akane, there's no
reason for you to run away.

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:29.400
Please come home!

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:32.410
I have a reason! I lost!

00:08:33.010 --> 00:08:36.280
Until I can defeat those two,
I can't come back to the Dojo.

00:08:36.350 --> 00:08:37.340
Akane!

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:39.280
Akane.

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:43.080
Kasumi!

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:47.510
There's no need for
you to overdo it.

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:51.360
I've brought you a few
things you might need.

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:53.120
Thanks, Kasumi.

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:54.920
Akane!

00:08:55.030 --> 00:08:58.760
Father. Akane will be just fine.

00:08:59.400 --> 00:09:02.240
You're always so kind, Kasumi!

00:09:06.340 --> 00:09:08.470
Akane, good luck!

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:13.710
I, Ryoga Hibiki, shall pray for
your victory from the shadows.

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:20.420
Wait a minute. If Akane wins,
she's still engaged to Ranma!

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:24.120
I don't want to see her lose!

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:27.390
But if she wins, she and Ranma...

00:09:29.400 --> 00:09:32.930
What am I gonna do!?

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:35.660
Hi, Ryoga!

00:09:36.110 --> 00:09:42.200
Akane! I-I wasn't spying
on you or anything!

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:46.910
I-I had some free time and
t-thought I'd go out for a walk!

00:09:47.990 --> 00:09:51.510
This is perfect!
Could you come with me?

00:09:52.590 --> 00:09:57.690
Will you help me train?
I can't seem to do it on my own.

00:09:58.700 --> 00:10:00.560
S-Sure! I'd be happy to!

00:10:05.240 --> 00:10:08.830
There is some truth in
what the Old Man said.

00:10:08.940 --> 00:10:12.270
Can't deny that as a girl,
I'm just not as strong.

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:17.970
Until I compensate for it, I
can't beat those two as a girl.

00:10:19.580 --> 00:10:21.780
Go for it, brats!

00:10:25.990 --> 00:10:28.860
Chestnuts Roasting
on an Open Fire!

00:10:34.630 --> 00:10:38.160
Yep, gotta use speed
more than strength!

00:10:44.480 --> 00:10:46.380
...24, 25...

00:10:47.540 --> 00:10:51.040
...26, 27, 28...

00:10:52.620 --> 00:10:54.880
Akane, keep it up!

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:00.950
That's good, Akane!

00:11:14.710 --> 00:11:17.440
Keep your arms in! Tighter!
Put some strength into it!

00:11:59.080 --> 00:12:00.070
Revenge?

00:12:00.220 --> 00:12:02.950
That may be an exaggeration.

00:12:03.050 --> 00:12:07.110
But it looks like she's
going to come back soon.

00:12:07.890 --> 00:12:11.490
She's gonna challenge
us to a rematch!

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:15.720
It doesn't matter what she does,
we'll fight her or anybody...

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:22.100
We practice to defend our rights
as the heirs to the Tendo Dojo!

00:12:23.810 --> 00:12:26.740
Yeah, about that...

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:31.640
Is that man really our father?

00:12:32.580 --> 00:12:34.070
What are you saying?

00:12:34.180 --> 00:12:38.590
Father proved it by signing his
name on the back of the photo!

00:12:40.160 --> 00:12:42.350
There's no mistake!

00:12:43.760 --> 00:12:48.200
So let's practice! We have
to protect the Tendo Dojo!

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:26.690
Ranma...

00:13:26.840 --> 00:13:28.630
Y-Yo.

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:31.470
Are you training?

00:13:32.010 --> 00:13:36.540
Yeah, I figured I'd
work on my girl side...

00:13:36.650 --> 00:13:40.170
...or I might lose a win-a-ble fight.

00:13:40.280 --> 00:13:43.190
So what are you doin' out here?

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:48.390
I thought that maybe I'd
tighten my moves a little.

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:52.490
It looks like I sort of let myself go.

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:08.880
I... I...

00:14:08.980 --> 00:14:10.950
What is it?

00:14:11.050 --> 00:14:13.540
Ranma. You go first.

00:14:13.650 --> 00:14:17.980
I, uh... I think we
should try it again.

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:21.150
If we combined forces...

00:14:21.260 --> 00:14:22.780
Akane!

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:29.070
I'm sorry! I overslept,
so I chased after you.

00:14:29.170 --> 00:14:34.430
To think that I found you!
I must have a guardian angel!

00:14:39.910 --> 00:14:41.340
Ranma?

00:14:41.450 --> 00:14:44.470
It looks like you're havin'
a good time trainin'!

00:14:44.580 --> 00:14:47.450
What's that? You wouldn't
be jealous, would you?

00:14:47.550 --> 00:14:49.750
J-Jealous?

00:14:50.350 --> 00:14:52.850
No one would get
jealous over YOU!

00:14:52.960 --> 00:14:59.950
My trainin' has nothin' to do
with the Dojo, or engagements!

00:15:01.770 --> 00:15:05.570
I'm just training as a
martial artist! That's all!

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:07.470
Let's go, Ryoga.

00:15:08.070 --> 00:15:11.270
Akane, you're holding my hand...

00:15:13.210 --> 00:15:16.110
Geez. How uncute can you get...

00:15:18.780 --> 00:15:20.980
That's it! I quit!

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:26.990
Why the heck do I gotta
fight as a girl anyway!?

00:15:27.090 --> 00:15:28.280
It's stupid!

00:15:28.390 --> 00:15:31.330
You've got the wrong idea, Ranma!

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:33.900
You gain nothing by
giving up your training!

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:36.260
And what about your
obligation to the Tendos?

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:37.960
Got nothin' to do with this!

00:15:38.070 --> 00:15:42.800
And those sisters may really
be Mr. Tendo's daughters!

00:15:43.070 --> 00:15:44.630
But, Ranma!

00:15:44.740 --> 00:15:47.040
You may be right
about the daughter thing...

00:15:47.140 --> 00:15:52.810
But if you break your engagement,
our free room and board...

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:09.030
Ranma...

00:16:21.140 --> 00:16:26.740
Akane! I'm not good
enough to be your trainer.

00:16:28.320 --> 00:16:34.880
Even when I'm training you,
I can't help but hope you lose.

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:40.760
Farewell, Akane.

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:46.000
I'm going off on a long
journey, to clear my mind.

00:16:48.810 --> 00:16:51.570
How mature I am!

00:16:53.100 --> 00:16:55.400
Training Hall Challengers:
Please Use Rear Entrance

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:10.990
This is destiny.

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:40.280
I challenge you!

00:17:52.070 --> 00:17:53.060
Akane!

00:17:56.310 --> 00:18:01.300
Akane, it seems you've
matured while you were gone!

00:18:19.400 --> 00:18:22.020
Natsume. Let's trade places.

00:18:22.130 --> 00:18:27.660
Let me fight. I want to
finish off Akane one-on-one.

00:18:29.310 --> 00:18:31.500
Okay. Do your best.

00:18:32.240 --> 00:18:34.230
I will! Natsume!

00:18:34.580 --> 00:18:39.910
A martial artist can never
avoid the path of battle.

00:18:40.950 --> 00:18:44.320
But I don't wanna see this fight!

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:49.790
Fight until a knockout!
Winner takes the Tendo Dojo.

00:18:49.890 --> 00:18:53.160
No time limit;
a one-round match!

00:18:53.260 --> 00:18:55.290
Fight!

00:19:04.110 --> 00:19:07.200
I can do this!
We're evenly matched!

00:19:07.310 --> 00:19:12.250
You're good! You've improved
so much in such a short time!

00:19:15.520 --> 00:19:19.510
What's wrong, Kurumi!?
Hurry up and finish her!

00:19:35.340 --> 00:19:37.530
Akane!

00:19:49.050 --> 00:19:50.710
Kurumi!

00:19:50.820 --> 00:19:51.910
Change places with me!

00:19:52.020 --> 00:19:53.150
Natsume!

00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:56.120
No! You can't just trade
places in the middle of a...

00:19:56.230 --> 00:19:58.290
My sister and I are of
one mind and one body!

00:20:03.200 --> 00:20:07.640
If I let Kurumi down,
I can't call myself her sister!

00:20:08.910 --> 00:20:10.570
Hold it!

00:20:11.910 --> 00:20:14.500
As heir to the Saotome School
of Anything-Goes Martial Arts...

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:18.740
...I, Ranma, have come to fight
for Akane, as honor demands!

00:20:18.850 --> 00:20:19.680
Ranma!

00:20:19.880 --> 00:20:20.680
Ranma!

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:21.510
Ranma!

00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:23.980
Two-on-two ain't a problem, is it?

00:20:24.090 --> 00:20:26.520
I'm gonna get you back twice
for what you did before!

00:20:27.260 --> 00:20:29.230
I'll allow you to lose again!

00:20:29.290 --> 00:20:29.950
Kurumi!

00:20:30.060 --> 00:20:32.190
Here she comes!

00:20:34.130 --> 00:20:36.330
Lemme take her!

00:20:37.270 --> 00:20:39.030
Look out!

00:20:43.740 --> 00:20:45.770
What an incredible combination!

00:20:45.880 --> 00:20:48.140
And look at our side!

00:20:49.080 --> 00:20:52.070
Hey! Get with it, Ranma!

00:20:53.580 --> 00:20:56.310
Ranma! That was so sweet!

00:20:56.420 --> 00:20:59.180
You took that blow for Akane!

00:20:59.990 --> 00:21:01.750
Did you come home
just to get in my way!?

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:05.190
Who's gettin' in WHOSE way?

00:21:05.300 --> 00:21:07.760
This goes beyond simple hatred!

00:21:08.060 --> 00:21:12.060
Don't get me wrong!
I'm not here to fight with you!

00:21:21.780 --> 00:21:26.480
Your tricks only work once!
And not against my new speed!

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:36.920
Natsume! Now!

00:21:39.330 --> 00:21:43.130
Anything-Goes Secret Attack!
Ring of Dragon Fire!

00:21:43.230 --> 00:21:46.830
Akane, this is it!
Quick, run into the spiral!

00:21:46.940 --> 00:21:49.130
Trust me!

00:21:53.510 --> 00:21:56.910
New and Improved!
Flying Dragon Ascension Wave!

00:21:57.010 --> 00:21:59.210
Horizontal Blast!

00:22:00.780 --> 00:22:02.980
Akane, go!

00:22:04.450 --> 00:22:05.420
Akane!

00:22:05.520 --> 00:22:08.420
The whirlwind of the
Ascension Wave...

00:22:08.530 --> 00:22:11.960
...is canceling out the Ring of
Dragon Fire's whirlpool effect!

00:22:16.030 --> 00:22:18.400
There's not enough power
in the Horizontal Blast!

00:22:18.500 --> 00:22:20.370
This is nothing!

00:22:20.470 --> 00:22:22.170
Right!

00:22:25.110 --> 00:22:29.370
Lightning Splits Attack!
AKA: Double Kick!

00:22:42.490 --> 00:22:44.690
We won!

00:23:02.050 --> 00:23:04.240
Kurumi!

00:23:08.250 --> 00:23:09.450
What the heck is this?

00:23:09.550 --> 00:23:11.610
What!?

00:23:11.720 --> 00:23:15.950
The Anything-Goes Martial
Arts logo on this gi...

00:23:16.460 --> 00:23:18.480
What's going on!?

00:23:18.600 --> 00:23:22.660
I was airing out my martial
arts gi on the roof...

00:23:23.300 --> 00:23:25.560
Master! What is this!?

00:23:27.140 --> 00:23:30.370
That's the jacket
I wore as a young man!

00:23:30.470 --> 00:23:37.940
What memories! An ambitious
youth traveling all over Japan.

00:23:38.580 --> 00:23:41.480
That's right, I have a photo...

00:23:42.520 --> 00:23:43.510
See?

00:23:43.620 --> 00:23:47.390
AAAAAAAAAAAAH!

00:23:48.020 --> 00:23:52.550
Th-Then the man in the
picture is the old letch!

00:23:53.030 --> 00:23:57.560
How!? How can they
mistake him for me!?

00:23:58.600 --> 00:24:04.940
I guess as time passes, you
remember only the good things.

00:24:06.540 --> 00:24:14.540
Then you used Soun Tendo's name
and tricked two little girls!?

00:24:15.450 --> 00:24:17.820
What insults!

00:24:17.920 --> 00:24:22.760
All I wanted was to give two
poor orphans a reason to live!

00:24:23.490 --> 00:24:28.290
I wonder what the
sisters are doing now?

00:24:28.630 --> 00:24:30.390
We're...

00:24:30.500 --> 00:24:33.030
...those two orphans...

00:24:33.470 --> 00:24:34.940
How sweet!

00:24:35.040 --> 00:24:40.500
After all these years!
I'm your father, Soun Tendo!

00:24:41.310 --> 00:24:43.300
DIE!

00:24:52.590 --> 00:24:54.420
I'll miss you!

00:24:54.520 --> 00:24:55.650
You said it.

00:24:56.660 --> 00:24:58.520
Do you really have to go?

00:24:59.630 --> 00:25:01.720
Life is training.

00:25:01.830 --> 00:25:05.560
When we're good enough never to
shame Anything-Goes Martial Arts,

00:25:05.670 --> 00:25:08.470
we'll come again to prove our skills.

00:25:08.670 --> 00:25:09.700
I'll be waiting!

00:25:09.810 --> 00:25:12.210
Dry up an' die, old man!

00:25:13.110 --> 00:25:15.080
Then we'll meet again!

00:25:15.240 --> 00:25:19.940
You bet! And next time,
we won't lose.

00:25:20.520 --> 00:25:21.810
I'll look forward to it!

00:25:21.920 --> 00:25:24.010
Take care of yourselves!

00:25:24.120 --> 00:25:26.320
Farewell.

00:25:36.870 --> 00:25:40.860
Thank you, Ranma, for saving me.

00:25:41.340 --> 00:25:42.830
Sorry about before.

00:25:42.940 --> 00:25:44.840
So you admit it.

00:25:44.940 --> 00:25:47.640
You shoulda just let me handle 'em.

00:25:47.740 --> 00:25:51.440
We couldn't have won if I hadn't
figured out their technique.

00:25:51.550 --> 00:25:56.350
What are you saying? I had to
be there to finish them off!

00:25:56.450 --> 00:25:57.110
Hey!

00:25:57.220 --> 00:25:58.280
What?

00:25:58.390 --> 00:26:00.580
You are so uncute!
